# Witness for ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffClose. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a foreign close - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffCloseWitness
TARGET: ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffClose
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a foreign close is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffClose", claimHead'["F"] \in CloseHeads)
--- REPLACE
Fails("ClaimHeadMeetsHandOffClose", FALSE)
--- END
